          <span class="product-brand-label">CUSTOMER FEEDBACK</span>
          <h2 id="product-reviews-title">Customer reviews</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="product-review-summary">
          {%- if review_total > 0 -%}
            {%- assign review_average = review_rating_sum | times: 1.0 | divided_by: review_total -%}
            <strong>{{ review_average | round: 1 }}</strong>
            <span class="product-rating-stars" aria-label="{{ review_average | round: 1 }} out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span>
            <span>{{ review_total }} review{% unless review_total == 1 %}s{% endunless %}</span>
          {%- else -%}
            <strong>4.9</strong>
            <span class="product-rating-stars" aria-label="4.9 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span>
            <span>6 reviews</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="product-review-grid">
        {%- if review_total > 0 -%}
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.settings.content != blank -%}
              <article class="product-review-card" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <div class="product-review-card-top">
                  <span class="product-rating-stars" aria-label="{{ block.settings.rating }} out of 5 stars">
                    {%- for star in (1..5) -%}
                      {%- if star <= block.settings.rating -%}★{%- else -%}☆{%- endif -%}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </span>
                  {%- if block.settings.date != blank -%}<time>{{ block.settings.date | escape }}</time>{%- endif -%}
                </div>
                {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}<h3>{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</h3>{%- endif -%}
                <p>{{ block.settings.content | escape }}</p>
                {%- if block.settings.name != blank -%}<span class="product-review-author">{{ block.settings.name | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              </article>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- if product.handle contains 'ct1' or product.title contains 'Fluted Pillar' -%}
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Majestic architectural center table</h3><p>Absolutely majestic center table. The fluted gold pillars at the four corners give it such an architectural, luxurious look. The black marble surface is heavy and gorgeous with realistic gold and white veins.</p><span class="product-review-author">Hamza Tariq (Lahore)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Elevated our entire drawing room</h3><p>We placed this in our main drawing room between our 8-seater sofa set and it completely elevated the entire room. The double-tier storage is very practical.</p><span class="product-review-author">Dr. Naila Arshad (Islamabad)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Top-notch quality &amp; secure packing</h3><p>Top-notch quality. I was a bit worried about shipping a marble table to Karachi, but the packaging had thick corner guards and bubble wrap. Perfectly intact.</p><span class="product-review-author">Zubair Ahmed (Karachi)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★☆</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Very solid build &amp; heavy marble</h3><p>Very solid build and lovely aesthetics. Slightly heavier than I expected which is actually great because it doesn't wobble at all on the carpet.</p><span class="product-review-author">Saira Bano (Rawalpindi)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Italian luxury look at fair price</h3><p>Gull e Gulzar never disappoints. The fluted pillar detailing looks like high-end imported Italian furniture. The price of Rs. 18,500 is completely justified.</p><span class="product-review-author">Kamran Farooq (Faisalabad)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>September 2026</time></div><h3>Flawless finish</h3><p>Everything from the polish on the marble to the sturdy gold frame is flawless. Fits perfectly in our living room.</p><span class="product-review-author">Bilal Siddiqui (Peshawar)</span></article>
          {%- elsif product.handle contains 'ct2' or product.title contains 'Stepped' -%}
